    "element": "Definition of the 90% CL upper limit in analysis.md, and the resulting stated_results.upper_limit",
    "evidence_text": "Numerical root: P(N<=2|5.3223)=0.10 (stated); the correct condition P(N<=3|s)=0.10 gives s=6.6808, the textbook classical Poisson 90% CL upper limit for n=3, b=0."
   }
  ],
