    "element": "combination method: w_i = 1/(stat_i^2 + syst_i^2), sigma = 1/sqrt(sum_i w_i)",
    "evidence_text": "Shared systematic => off-diagonal covariance rho*0.291*0.198. BLUE with rho=1: 10.2768 +- 0.2708 vs stated 10.2278 +- 0.2174 (sigma 20% low, central shift 0.049 ~ 0.23 sigma)."
   }
  ],
  "state": "completed",
