    "evidence_text": "With N1=793 and N2=461: S=1254 and A=0.264753. Correct sigma_A = 2*sqrt(793*461)/1254^1.5 = sqrt((1-A^2)/S) = 0.0272314. The stated value 0.0292121 follows the formula |A| sqrt(S/D^2 + 1/S), which leaves out the -2 cov(D,S)/(D S) term."
   }
  ],
